# R49 (F-16, F-20): the two shapes of scratch file that have been left behind in
# a working tree once each — a debug script beside the source, and a second
# Playwright config with a hard-coded port. Ignoring them is what keeps the next
# one out of `git status` and out of a commit; `tests/docs/hygiene.test.ts` is
# what keeps them out of the tree at all. Anchored: `debug-*` alone would also
# swallow a `src/ui/debug-overlay.tsx` someone meant to commit.
/debug-*
/scripts/debug-*
/playwright.*.config.*
/playwright-*.config.*
/redesign
